# Funtroo — Windsurf Rules

Project: Next.js 14 adult wellness e-commerce | funtroo.in | India | 18+

## Stack
- Framework: Next.js 14 App Router (TypeScript)
- Styling: Tailwind CSS with custom f-* color tokens
- Database: MongoDB + Mongoose (models in /models)
- Auth: NextAuth v4 (JWT strategy)
- Payments: Razorpay (server-side only)
- State: Zustand (cart + browsing history in /lib/store.ts)
- Icons: lucide-react exclusively
- Toasts: react-hot-toast (configured in app/layout.tsx)

## Absolute Rules
1. COLORS: Use f-* Tailwind tokens only. Never raw hex. (f-purple, f-dark, f-light, f-soft, f-border, f-accent, f-muted, f-mid, f-pink, f-green, f-gray, f-grayBg, f-greenBg)
2. DB: Call `await connectDB()` first in every API route
3. MODELS: `mongoose.models.X || mongoose.model('X', Schema)` always
4. CART: `useCart()` from lib/store.ts — never useState for cart
5. LOYALTY: Import from lib/loyalty.ts — Silver(5%), Gold(10%), Platinum(15%)
6. FONTS: font-display (Cormorant Garamond) and font-sans (DM Sans) via class names only
7. BLOG: HTML content rendered via dangerouslySetInnerHTML with prose classes
8. FORMS: onSubmit + preventDefault — never form action=""
9. AUTH: 'use client' + useSession() on client; getServerSession(authOptions) on server
10. SECURITY: Never expose passwords; always select('-password') on Customer queries

